@startuml
scale 620 width
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox
participant "EditorSession\nClient" as Session
participant "CommandExecutor\nInvoker" as Executor
participant "MoveShapeCommand\nConcreteCommand" as Command
participant "SvgDocument\nReceiver" as Document

== 成功执行 move ==
Session -> Command : new MoveShapeCommand(document, id, dx, dy)
Session -> Executor : execute(command)
Executor -> Command : execute()
Command -> Document : move(id, dx, dy)
note right of Document
  准备并应用移动；局部反向数据
  保存在文档内部，返回回执
end note
Document --> Command : MoveReceipt
Command --> Executor : MoveChange
Executor -> Executor : undo 栈入栈；清空 redo 栈
Executor --> Session : MoveChange

== 成功执行 undo ==
Session -> Executor : undo()
Executor -> Command : undo()
Command -> Document : undoMove(receipt)
Document --> Command : MoveLocation
Command --> Executor : MoveChange
Executor -> Executor : undo 栈出栈；redo 栈入栈
Executor --> Session : MoveChange
@enduml
